1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,629
How does the game end?

2
00:00:01,949 --> 00:00:02,994
And who wins?

3
00:00:03,314 --> 00:00:04,509
Let's find out.

4
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:09,928
Ana's yellow tile fills the last space in row two.

5
00:00:10,248 --> 00:00:11,763
It scores seven points.

6
00:00:12,866 --> 00:00:14,487
That's five tiles across.

7
00:00:14,807 --> 00:00:16,429
It's called a complete row.

8
00:00:17,533 --> 00:00:19,389
A complete row ends the game.

9
00:00:19,709 --> 00:00:23,015
But first, everyone finishes moving tiles to their wall.

10
00:00:24,133 --> 00:00:25,583
Then the game is over.

11
00:00:25,903 --> 00:00:27,333
No new round starts.

12
00:00:28,466 --> 00:00:30,663
A full column does not end the game.

13
00:00:30,983 --> 00:00:32,541
Only a full row does.

14
00:00:33,666 --> 00:00:35,778
Now everyone adds bonus points.

15
00:00:36,098 --> 00:00:37,911
A bonus is extra points.

16
00:00:38,231 --> 00:00:40,215
Let's look at Ana's final wall.

17
00:00:41,333 --> 00:00:43,658
Each complete row: plus two points.

18
00:00:43,978 --> 00:00:45,066
Ana has one.

19
00:00:46,199 --> 00:00:48,738
Each complete column: plus seven points.

20
00:00:49,058 --> 00:00:50,210
Ana has two.

21
00:00:50,530 --> 00:00:51,639
That's fourteen.

22
00:00:52,766 --> 00:00:56,478
Each colour with all five tiles on your wall: plus ten points.

23
00:00:56,798 --> 00:00:58,867
Ana has all five blue tiles.

24
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,349
Ana's bonus: two plus seven plus seven plus ten.

25
00:01:03,669 --> 00:01:05,205
That's twenty six points!

26
00:01:06,333 --> 00:01:08,338
The player with the most points wins.

27
00:01:09,166 --> 00:01:11,747
A tie means two players have the same points.

28
00:01:12,067 --> 00:01:14,542
Then the one with more complete rows wins.

29
00:01:15,666 --> 00:01:16,733
Still tied?

30
00:01:17,053 --> 00:01:18,354
Then they share the win.

31
00:01:19,466 --> 00:01:20,362
Remember.

32
00:01:20,682 --> 00:01:24,373
A complete row ends the game, after that round's wall moves.

33
00:01:24,693 --> 00:01:29,514
Then add bonuses: two per row, seven per column, and ten per full colour.

34
00:01:29,834 --> 00:01:32,031
A tie goes to more complete rows.

35
00:01:32,351 --> 00:01:34,271
Next: the grey wall variant.
